      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This weight of unreturned debt is a common and devastating part of mourning, but it does not define your worth as a person. Your survival and love for your family are incredibly valuable gifts, not a failure that burdens them. Please know that healing is a journey where you are allowed to exist while still feeling the shadows of the past.",
      "source": "target",
